-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

physics/bounce_law_hawkeye_holdout.json and physics/bounce_reference.py contain coefficients
fitted to the public Hawk-Eye CourtVision trajectory data (Roland Garros 2019-2021, Australian
Open 2020-2021). That data is not redistributed here. Player heights in
cv/pipeline/player_biometrics.json are public ATP/WTA profile values listed with their URLs.
The images in docs/samples/ are single reduced frames from one broadcast, included only to
illustrate the tool's output.
